OL,3,GNEWSAWoman and children escape injury
OL,4,Aafter petrol bomb attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman and three children have escaped
OL,7,Finjury after a petrol bomb was thrown
OL,8,Fat a house in County Down, causing a
OL,9,Fblaze.
OL,11,FIt happened before 20:30 BST on Tuesday
OL,12,Fevening on Struell Avenue in
OL,13,FDownpatrick.
OL,15,FA 19-year-old man has since been
OL,16,Farrested on suspicion of arson
OL,17,Fendangering life with intent and
OL,18,Fremains in custody.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,418,410,260,120,0,100
